<div class="surfdoc-summary" role="doc-abstract"><div class="surfdoc-summary-label">Summary</div><p>The 0.27 panels layout: the CloudSurf app's arrangement as SurfDoc source —
the Navbar rail, a navigator seat plus a pinned Surfy seat, four Desks and
the ten presets. Rendered at 390 / 834 / 1280 to pin the per-class slot set.</p></div>
